*> PLB-C064 duplicate-condition-value: two condition names of the same
*> item with the same values, in any order and however written.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DUPCOND.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  ACCOUNT-STATUS      PIC X VALUE "O".
    88  STATUS-OPEN     VALUE "O".
    88  STATUS-CLOSED   VALUE "C".
    88  STATUS-ACTIVE   VALUE "O".
01  RETRY-COUNT         PIC 99 VALUE 0.
    88  NO-RETRIES      VALUE 0.
    88  FIRST-TRY       VALUE ZERO.
    88  FEW-RETRIES     VALUE 1 THRU 3, 5.
    88  SOME-RETRIES    VALUE 5, 01 THROUGH 3.
01  REGION-CODE         PIC XX VALUE SPACES.
    88  REGION-NORTH    VALUE "N " "NE".
    88  REGION-UPPER    VALUES ARE "NE", "N".
    *> Not reported: a superset, a different value, other items.
    88  REGION-VALID    VALUE "N" "NE" "S" "SE".
    88  REGION-SOUTH    VALUE "S".
01  RATE                PIC 9V9(4) VALUE 0.
    88  RATE-UNIT       VALUE 1.0 1E0.
    88  RATE-ONE        VALUE 1.
*> Not reported: the same text twice, and neither named below.
01  RETURN-MESSAGE      PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
    88  MSG-BAD-ACCOUNT VALUE "ACCOUNT NUMBER IS NOT VALID".
    88  MSG-NO-ACCOUNT  VALUE "ACCOUNT NUMBER IS NOT VALID".
01  OTHER-STATUS        PIC X VALUE "O".
    88  OTHER-OPEN      VALUE "O".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF STATUS-OPEN OR STATUS-CLOSED OR STATUS-ACTIVE
        DISPLAY "STATUS"
    END-IF
    IF NO-RETRIES OR FIRST-TRY OR FEW-RETRIES OR SOME-RETRIES
        DISPLAY "RETRY"
    END-IF
    IF REGION-NORTH OR REGION-UPPER OR REGION-VALID OR REGION-SOUTH
        DISPLAY "REGION"
    END-IF
    IF OTHER-OPEN OR RATE-UNIT OR RATE-ONE
        DISPLAY "OTHER"
    END-IF
    DISPLAY RETURN-MESSAGE
    STOP RUN.
